{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds and takes an object, checks its properties, completes a specific task, and scans area for more. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToAnotherLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
